values ('d1a8c4e7-2b59-4f06-9c31-5e0a7b3d6f18', 'sport-and-exercise-psychology', 'Sport and Exercise Psychology', 'This course examines psychological factors in sport, exercise, performance, coaching, physical activity, and well-being. Students study motivation, personality, identity, arousal, stress, anxiety, confidence, resilience, goal setting, behavior change, imagery, self-talk, attention, concentration, flow, mindfulness, group dynamics, leadership, exercise adherence, mental health, burnout, injury rehabilitation, return to play, diversity, ethics, evidence, and applied consultation.');

