tention, decision-making, and motor execution.", "children": [{"id": "93baa6d2-7347-4a40-8ecc-a96b3e592d53", "type": "concept", "title": "State and trait anxiety"}, {"id": "d4e419d1-c184-4bb6-8d55-e9ae605ad57e", "type": "concept", "title": "Somatic and cognitive anxiety"}, {"id": "9fd1cfe0-60f3-46f6-8c3d-c60b53fae245", "type": "concept", "title": "Choking under pressure"}, {"id": "3ab5218d-c087-4520-b721-53cd175ec109", "type": "concept", "title": "Catastrophe and inverted-U ideas"}]}, {"id": "20041a68-e926-4cdb-a981-bd839a95a8e7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Regulation strategies", "description": "Students practice tools for pressure management.", "children": [{"id": "76349db3-4d96-4ce4-b8e8-ddee4aa40d29", "type": "concept", "title": "Breathing"}, {"id": "4259b451-97ae-4d02-a80a-8ac23dc30ea8", "type": "concept", "title": "Routines"}, {"id": "a7c60b52-828b-4529-a946-160306d43de1", "type": "concept", "title": "Reappraisal"}, {"id": "ba15a144-ac2c-4b08-bdf0-c553d7109c14", "type": "concept", "title": "Simulation and exposure"}]}]}, {"id": "582d6c17-a9fa-4e8e-88c3-251449babb72", "type": "topic", "title": "Confidence, Self-Efficacy, and Resilience", "description": "Develop practical understanding of belief, coping, setback response, and sustained performance confidence.", "children": [{"id": "b3fbd553-8494-4b33-8a57-2ff8d6dc7e87", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Confidence sources", "description": "Students learn where confidence comes from and how it can be built responsibly.", "children": [{"id": "662a5ae2-0921-4e00-8fe2-d93f57b2a916", "type": "concept", "title": "Mastery experiences"}, {"id": "7d122744-33b0-4d61-a821-471efd413cdf", "type": "concept", "title": "Vicarious learning"}, {"id": "732b3a2b-10c1-4c77-a1f3-2a092751cfa1", "type": "concept", "title": "Verbal persuasion"}, {"id": "209fa4e8-de1f-4681-bd40-60314f8fb061", "type": "concept", "title": "Physiological interpretation"}]}, {"id": "4bef60be-fe37-4ea0-b249-c758754ed575", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Resilience and coping", "description": "Students examine how athletes and exercisers respond to setbacks.", "children": [{"id": "f4d0d66a-bdf9-4a81-832c-3cfc7e67a8c8", "type": "concept", "title": "Coping strategies"}, {"id": "b71537b3-5073-43d6-9153-63f38ddaa1c7", "type": "concept", "title": "Growth mindset"}, {"id": "27dca402-00d2-4954-8061-bf2d91a28975", "type": "concept", "title": "Stress inoculation"}, {"id": "f6401555-e5c6-4747-b6c1-3302d12a1b6b", "type": "concept", "title": "Recovery after failure"}]}, {"id": "32201614-c75c-4cd2-b520-833b2195a5eb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Confidence pitfalls", "description": "Students distinguish durable confidence from denial, arrogance, or avoidance.", "children": [{"id": "0741d28b-0dde-4f59-ba11-78d3052d3f44", "type": "concept", "title": "Overconfidence"}, {"id": "24c20c0c-73e6-4877-8eb8-f9e2c5358363", "type": "concept", "title": "Fragile confidence"}, {"id": "5060ca4a-7d7d-404d-a2cb-e0ae5370140a", "type": "concept", "title": "Comparison traps"}, {"id": "cfce99ae-e24f-417b-a8dc-8832049a77e1", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence-based self-belief"}]}]}, {"id": "aea86595-9e33-41d9-b7e7-aff223d3ce45", "type": "topic", "title": "Goal Setting, Planning, and Behavior Change", "description": "Translate intentions into structured goals, habits, feedback loops, and behavior-change plans.", "children": [{"id": "4997a8f6-a593-49e7-b4a2-f46b0336a857", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Goal-setting principles", "description": "Students learn to design goals that guide behavior and attention.", "children": [{"id": "6df9c9f6-f077-48cd-ad7b-efe82d045209", "type": "concept", "title": "Outcome goals"}, {"id": "22a1e21e-9294-4dee-9111-07ade5a8942e", "type": "concept", "title": "Performance goals"}, {"id": "c663df37-2554-4359-b4e5-1065ba19aa3d", "type": "concept", "title": "Process goals"}, {"id": "4ea30812-5336-4339-8534-615bf3a90863", "type": "concept", "title": "SMART and flexible goals"}]}, {"id": "1d8952ff-2e1f-4e8c-b8f9-20e1c6c1904c", "type"