": "Role clarity"}, {"id": "502d1653-ba9d-4123-a974-00c1323b6117", "type": "concept", "title": "Collective efficacy"}]}, {"id": "7d471351-630c-4f3f-ad85-6fe587f3085e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Group processes", "description": "Students analyze how groups help or hurt motivation and performance.", "children": [{"id": "a5133b5b-7eb6-4053-b2df-18fe2b47f22e", "type": "concept", "title": "Social facilitation"}, {"id": "fd49ae47-e46c-4e9a-8209-fd6c5de8264d", "type": "concept", "title": "Social loafing"}, {"id": "4e252b25-76cd-4a14-a119-6ce20e7faeec", "type": "concept", "title": "Norms"}, {"id": "e481a861-0265-4ee5-801d-462c26d5c00f", "type": "concept", "title": "Conflict and communication"}]}, {"id": "4289dd5a-fdb2-4a85-8b41-01f9dfa4d096", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Inclusion and belonging", "description": "Students learn how team climate affects participation and well-being.", "children": [{"id": "845f2759-2a82-45a2-96df-53c1f1d3e879", "type": "concept", "title": "Psychological safety"}, {"id": "04bd4667-d02a-4038-878a-39d467de02e3", "type": "concept", "title": "Equity and inclusion"}, {"id": "f9d5d93b-5020-48cd-bdc4-9adf230e7e1a", "type": "concept", "title": "Peer support"}, {"id": "8a8a8eb0-383d-4bae-9068-e0edcf8815c5", "type": "concept", "title": "Hazing and harmful norms"}]}]}, {"id": "ccdcfc16-f4bf-40c3-a082-eac18d2bc3ec", "type": "topic", "title": "Leadership, Coaching Communication, and Motivational Climate", "description": "Prepare students to evaluate and practice communication that supports learning, performance, and well-being.", "children": [{"id": "12812995-f6d2-4596-9621-c960d708bd4e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Leadership styles", "description": "Students compare leadership approaches and their effects on motivation and trust.", "children": [{"id": "0ff1fd76-2fa9-4547-b427-4d480e22da47", "type": "concept", "title": "Transformational leadership"}, {"id": "bc555edb-eb9a-4ad7-90eb-df5175340f17", "type": "concept", "title": "Autonomy-supportive coaching"}, {"id": "1c6684e0-6327-4571-bfe4-ed3614617278", "type": "concept", "title": "Controlling climates"}, {"id": "5f994748-0e18-4c21-9c1f-975bbf703e89", "type": "concept", "title": "Servant leadership concepts"}]}, {"id": "329a1fee-65a5-43c7-99f1-c17337f97123", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Communication skills", "description": "Students practice the language of effective coaching and exercise support.", "children": [{"id": "1618153c-bbb0-4dd6-acbd-827b90fc634a", "type": "concept", "title": "Feedback timing"}, {"id": "55a60150-733d-4388-ae64-4aa1e129d3c7", "type": "concept", "title": "Questioning"}, {"id": "2dcc9b45-6e25-497a-8604-a4ec64f71a94", "type": "concept", "title": "Active listening"}, {"id": "3f7b9772-37ab-458f-a4e4-64c1ef6db940", "type": "concept", "title": "Difficult conversations"}]}, {"id": "3c4da7cd-d946-4719-b312-62c24d25dc45", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Motivational climate", "description": "Leaders shape whether people feel safe to learn, fail, and improve.", "children": [{"id": "ed6e786b-8641-4c45-9e7e-196096e17ae7", "type": "concept", "title": "Mastery climate"}, {"id": "57ccae47-adca-40dc-a4a1-d22435decdc5", "type": "concept", "title": "Error climate"}, {"id": "8acb49e8-c5f4-4c04-8090-c2401129e870", "type": "concept", "title": "Reward structures"}, {"id": "4382bc7e-61b7-4125-8ec2-1630e1ef18cb", "type": "concept", "title": "Coach-athlete relationship"}]}]}, {"id": "a2b46a54-c2e7-4b47-88e6-d490c505abfe", "type": "topic", "title": "Exercise Adherence, Physical Activity Behavior, and Public Health", "description": "Connect psychology to lifelong movement, health promotion, barriers, identity, and sustainable exercise.", "children": [{"id": "2a18e16f-e5cf-4d65-a74c-8f6a93969ad8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Adherence barriers", "description": "Students learn why intention does not automatically become action.", "children": [{"id": "b7c631f3-a604-4aa3-b6a9-423cc24f4e15", "type": "concept", "title": "Time and access"}, {"id": "12050250-62bd-447f-