on and anxiety signs"}, {"id": "4d5d9a63-e75a-4796-8de7-46cff28e048e", "type": "concept", "title": "Eating disorder risk"}, {"id": "c627c0df-fe4e-43dc-9ce9-b3310846e92a", "type": "concept", "title": "Substance use"}, {"id": "13084426-432d-40d5-bb34-69f711b4c22f", "type": "concept", "title": "Sleep and stress"}]}, {"id": "95920e15-0a1f-4d94-885e-1b2bc7e35be6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Burnout and overtraining", "description": "Students connect psychological and physiological strain.", "children": [{"id": "fc37050f-17c7-42c1-b637-0d90460df153", "type": "concept", "title": "Emotional exhaustion"}, {"id": "40cd10d2-f1dd-4e2b-b7e1-f49b11227a49", "type": "concept", "title": "Reduced accomplishment"}, {"id": "ec47786d-4419-40a0-b9e5-433debee9b14", "type": "concept", "title": "Sport devaluation"}, {"id": "89a75bbf-9f3b-4c9f-a633-a6dc3cd8c915", "type": "concept", "title": "Recovery imbalance"}]}, {"id": "88ce6c76-6ae6-4122-a853-a83697f2d7c0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Support and referral", "description": "Students learn ethical, compassionate next steps when concern exceeds their scope.", "children": [{"id": "f7e1afcb-337d-414a-8aef-39ec77338735", "type": "concept", "title": "Conversation skills"}, {"id": "fef3ea58-96a7-4144-aaef-161b0d0ed4fb", "type": "concept", "title": "Crisis awareness"}, {"id": "9f5e20d4-7577-46c2-90b8-b85b519cd9e5", "type": "concept", "title": "Referral resources"}, {"id": "086c648f-8d0e-43a8-bdab-19a12bc72d1d", "type": "concept", "title": "Documentation and privacy"}]}]}, {"id": "14819778-efa3-4c3f-a109-216aa98c8bd9", "type": "topic", "title": "Injury, Rehabilitation Psychology, Return to Play, and Performance Transitions", "description": "Apply sport psychology to injury response, rehab adherence, identity disruption, and transitions.", "children": [{"id": "8c72607c-510b-4a1a-a26f-53a5cf4fc4d2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Psychological response to injury", "description": "Students learn how injury affects identity, motivation, fear, and 