rupt attention, decision-making, and motor execution.", "children": [{"id": "93baa6d2-7347-4a40-8ecc-a96b3e592d53", "type": "concept", "title": "State and trait anxiety"}, {"id": "d4e419d1-c184-4bb6-8d55-e9ae605ad57e", "type": "concept", "title": "Somatic and cognitive anxiety"}, {"id": "9fd1cfe0-60f3-46f6-8c3d-c60b53fae245", "type": "concept", "title": "Choking under pressure"}, {"id": "3ab5218d-c087-4520-b721-53cd175ec109", "type": "concept", "title": "Catastrophe and inverted-U ideas"}]}, {"id": "20041a68-e926-4cdb-a981-bd839a95a8e7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Regulation strategies", "description": "Students practice tools for pressure management.", "children": [{"id": "76349db3-4d96-4ce4-b8e8-ddee4aa40d29", "type": "concept", "title": "Breathing"}, {"id": "4259b451-97ae-4d02-a80a-8ac23dc30ea8", "type": "concept", "title": "Routines"}, {"id": "a7c60b52-828b-4529-a946-160306d43de1", "type": "concept", "title": "Reappraisal"}, {"id": "ba15a144-ac2c-4b08-bdf0-c553d7109c14", "type": "concept", "title": "Simulation and exposure"}]}]}, {"id": "582d6c17-a9fa-4e8e-88c3-251449babb72", "type": "topic", "title": "Confidence, Self-Efficacy, and Resilience", "description": "Develop practical understanding of belief, coping, setback response, and sustained performance confidence.", "children": [{"id": "b3fbd553-8494-4b33-8a57-2ff8d6dc7e87", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Confidence sources", "description": "Students learn where confidence comes from and how it can be built responsibly.", "children": [{"id": "662a5ae2-0921-4e00-8fe2-d93f57b2a916", "type": "concept", "title": "Mastery experiences"}, {"id": "7d122744-33b0-4d61-a821-471efd413cdf", "type": "concept", "title": "Vicarious learning"}, {"id": "732b3a2b-10c1-4c77-a1f3-2a092751cfa1", "type": "concept", "title": "Verbal persuasion"}, {"id": "209fa4e8-de1f-4681-bd40-60314f8fb061", "type": "concept", "title": "Physiological interpretation"}]}, {"id": "4bef60be-fe37-4ea0-b249-c758754ed575", "type": "subtopic", "title": "R